    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "漢娜，你那邊的進度如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "搞破壞我可太擅長了！根本用不上設備，樓層間的天花板老子可以直接砸出一個洞，上下快速移動的木梯都架好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "那就好，昨天來不及支援達格達的意外不能再發生了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "地雷區缺口我補上了！好消息是本蒂勒還有氣，我正拖著他回地下室治療！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "達格達小姐今天醒了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "……醒了，但不方便移動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "她太拚命了，我盡量照顧她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "Misery先生，薩卡茲軍營那邊是否有新的動向？他們前三天強行攻樓的成果不大，說不定已經有了新的計劃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "您還能找到更多的地雷讓我們擴大地雷防禦區嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "text": "恐怕不行，我們那位薩卡茲朋友的游擊僱傭兵團的位置可不好找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "text": "現在能依靠的只有我*電流聲*——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "巫術*電流聲*訊號——擾*電流聲*——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "有什麼東西在干擾訊號？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "那是——*嘈雜的聲音*——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "——戴*尖銳的電流聲*——逃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "戴菲恩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "text": "你終於醒了，戴菲恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "我……頭很痛……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "text": "你昨天在外面救人時沒有來得及撤退，他們的移動戰爭祭壇試射波及了你的位置……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "……昨天？……移動……戰爭祭壇？本呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "text": "哈，看來我們兩個人都錯過了很多東西——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "text": "——嘶，我的背還是很痛，摩根的縫針手藝真不太行。本還活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "text": "誰……把我帶回來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "text": "漢娜，她當時發現你還留在外面，就第一時間從三樓的窗戶跳出去把你拖回室內。",
