    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "我還需要一個人隨時待命，一旦我沒有成功，必須要立馬接替我攻擊核心，Misery先生能為我們爭取的時間不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "text": "我來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "我呢，維娜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "摩根……我也需要你隨時關注他們的動向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "……",
